{
  "$comment": [
    "Design tokens of Mridanga Seva: the one place a colour, a size or a font is chosen (docs/DECISIONS.md #336).",
    "node design/build-tokens.mjs writes app/src/theme/tokens.generated.ts and website/src/tokens.css from this file;",
    "the app's tests (app/tests/design-tokens.test.mjs) fail when either is stale or a declared pair is below its contrast.",
    "A value is a primitive reference 'family.step', or a literal (#hex or rgba(...)).",
    "choices = the team decision of audit phase 5 question 1 (DECISIONS #336; answered after 21-10-2026):",
    "header 'indigo' (option A, the website's night band) or 'saffron' (today); primary 'deep' (#9A4307, the website's",
    "accent) or 'bright' (#B45309, today). Every combination is contrast-checked, so switching is one line here + build."
  ],
  "choices": { "header": "indigo", "primary": "deep" },

  "primitive": {
