    "gold": { "300": "#FFD27A", "400": "#E0B25C" },
    "$night": "Dark mode page and cards (Praveen 14-10-2026, D2 midnight navy, #358): Krishna's syama, the colour of a rain cloud at night. 840 (page top), 820 (cards) and 760 (fields, sheets) since the night gradient (15-10-2026, #371): cards stay lighter than the lightest page.",
